    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashen Vale: Where They Fell</strong> is a <strong>third-person psychological horror adventure</strong> set deep in the ruins of a cursed Japanese village. You play as <strong>Yuna Sato</strong>, an archaeologist sent to investigate the sudden disappearance of a dig team who unearthed something ancient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by scattered journals, ghostly visions, and your creeping dread, you\u2019ll uncover what happened the night the village fell \u2014 and what now waits beneath. As the line between reality and ritual blurs, you\u2019ll be forced to make choices that shape your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Third-person psychological horror</strong> focused on exploration, story, and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>Explore a forgotten village</strong> cursed by ritual, blood, and grief</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Uncover the past</strong> through environmental storytelling, found recordings, and visions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b <strong>Supernatural encounters</strong> with spirits of the dead and vampiric horrors lurking in the dark</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd00 <strong>Narrative-driven gameplay</strong> with <strong>choices that affect the story's ending</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashen Vale: Where They Fell</strong> is a <strong>third-person psychological horror adventure</strong> set deep in the ruins of a cursed Japanese village. You play as <strong>Yuna Sato</strong>, an archaeologist sent to investigate the sudden disappearance of a dig team who unearthed something ancient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by scattered journals, ghostly visions, and your creeping dread, you\u2019ll uncover what happened the night the village fell \u2014 and what now waits beneath. As the line between reality and ritual blurs, you\u2019ll be forced to make choices that shape your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Third-person psychological horror</strong> focused on exploration, story, and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>Explore a forgotten village</strong> cursed by ritual, blood, and grief</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Uncover the past</strong> through environmental storytelling, found recordings, and visions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b <strong>Supernatural encounters</strong> with spirits of the dead and vampiric horrors lurking in the dark</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd00 <strong>Narrative-driven gameplay</strong> with <strong>choices that affect the story's ending</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
